OL,13,G     Contender
OL,14,     FR is for Rebellion. Marlon Brando
OL,15,     Fchanged screen acting in his own
OL,16,     Fcontradictory way. Antonia Quirke
OL,17,     Fmarks his centenary with her
OL,18,     Farchival A-Z of his brilliant,
OL,19,     Fmaddening career.
